WEBVTT

00:08.875 --> 00:16.916
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.916 --> 00:24.914
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.432 --> 00:36.236
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.236 --> 00:39.239
Believing, dreaming

00:39.239 --> 00:43.076
We are searching

00:43.076 --> 00:48.207
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:50.016 --> 00:58.425
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.425 --> 01:02.996
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.996 --> 01:05.665
Ah, surely someday

01:05.665 --> 01:13.940
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.940 --> 01:18.900
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.447 --> 01:27.080
Let's begin our journey

01:32.859 --> 01:35.395
Move it, move it, move it, move it, move it!

01:35.395 --> 01:37.795
Make way for Lord Narugami
on his commute to work!

01:39.766 --> 01:42.132
Good morning! Let's make today
another good one!

01:44.737 --> 01:47.035
You can go ahead and leave the tray.

01:47.507 --> 01:48.997
Thank you very much!

01:49.843 --> 01:51.311
I can't eat another bite!

01:51.311 --> 01:55.281
Me neither. I can't finish this burger.
I'm already full.

01:55.281 --> 01:57.350
They really give you a lot of fries here!

01:57.350 --> 01:58.351
Wanna go?

01:58.351 --> 02:00.819
Yeah. I think the trash was...

02:01.421 --> 02:03.048
Over there.

02:05.358 --> 02:08.561
I will not tolerate people wasting food!

02:08.561 --> 02:11.064
If you buy it, eat it! If you're not
gonna eat it, don't buy it!

02:11.064 --> 02:14.000
Don't you scumbags get it?!

02:14.000 --> 02:16.102
And to everyone else: Mark my words!

02:16.102 --> 02:19.594
I swear I'll be back! I shall return!

02:22.108 --> 02:24.377
What do they mean I'm fired?

02:24.377 --> 02:26.004
What did I do?!

02:28.548 --> 02:29.845
Damn.

02:30.783 --> 02:32.751
Time to find another job, eh?

02:35.088 --> 02:38.491
Ours was a short relationship,
but thank you for everything.

02:38.491 --> 02:40.459
Keep on smiling, all right?

02:42.595 --> 02:44.062
See ya.

02:52.739 --> 02:54.741
Thor, God of Thunder...

02:54.741 --> 02:58.438
My plan has a part for you to play as well.

02:59.279 --> 03:04.945
The 19th Night
A Tale of Narugami's Devotion

03:19.532 --> 03:22.968
All right! Take a little rest and
then do 500 more!

03:25.071 --> 03:27.699
Habitual training is the key to success.

03:27.974 --> 03:29.601
No way.

03:31.244 --> 03:34.702
Those aren't words I'd expect to hear
from a habitual part-timer.

03:35.014 --> 03:37.414
Even your work at this dojo
is part-time, right?

03:37.984 --> 03:39.952
Keep quiet, you observers!

03:40.286 --> 03:42.151
Yes, sir!

03:42.855 --> 03:46.025
Cripes. At least Loki isn't here.

03:46.025 --> 03:47.322
Mr. Narugami.

03:50.997 --> 03:52.521
Oh, Yayoi!

03:53.566 --> 03:55.568
How is the assistant instructor position?

03:55.568 --> 03:57.195
Have you settled into it yet?

03:57.403 --> 03:59.305
Yeah, I guess.

03:59.305 --> 04:01.933
We were just about to start doing
1,000 downward thrusts.

04:02.408 --> 04:03.843
No way!
That's more than what you said!

04:03.843 --> 04:04.811
That's more than what you said!

04:04.811 --> 04:07.146
So, how is your father doing?

04:07.146 --> 04:08.481
Just fine.

04:08.481 --> 04:15.284
Thanks to you, he can go to the hospital
without having to worry about his classes.

04:15.755 --> 04:17.882
I hope he gets better soon.

04:18.691 --> 04:21.990
Yes. That will also be thanks to you.

04:23.029 --> 04:27.989
Well, I wouldn't be a nice guy if I
didn't help someone in distress.

04:30.436 --> 04:33.894
But it's not just my father
who's relying on you.

04:36.943 --> 04:38.410
I am too.

04:39.445 --> 04:41.072
Yayoi...

04:49.922 --> 04:52.356
Narukami's got a girlfriend?

04:52.992 --> 04:56.796
That's right! And how Narugami
got such a cute girlfriend

04:56.796 --> 04:58.498
is another strange mystery!

04:58.498 --> 05:01.956
So this girl at the dojo, um...

05:02.468 --> 05:03.935
Yayoi Hirasaka.

05:04.137 --> 05:09.632
Right. This Yayoi person really,
uh, loves Narugami?

05:10.543 --> 05:12.534
There's no doubt!

05:13.646 --> 05:15.876
In love with old Narukami, huh?

05:16.149 --> 05:20.449
Her father, the dojo's instructor, got sick, and
the dojo was in danger of closing down.

05:21.888 --> 05:26.689
At this rate Narugami could
actually inherit the dojo.

05:27.660 --> 05:29.685
You think he'll be adopted into the family?!

05:30.196 --> 05:32.332
This is turning into more
and more of a mystery!

05:32.332 --> 05:36.792
Yeah, this might be Enjaku Detective
Agency's biggest case yet!

05:47.513 --> 05:49.215
Hey, Narukami!

05:49.215 --> 05:51.979
Loki?! What are you doing here?

05:52.318 --> 05:54.320
We're on our way home from shopping.

05:54.320 --> 05:56.556
Oh, is this the girl I've heard so much about?

05:56.556 --> 05:57.853
Good afternoon.

05:58.825 --> 06:00.292
Nice to meet you!

06:01.694 --> 06:04.063
What the heck do you mean,
"heard so much about"?!

06:04.063 --> 06:06.759
Rumor has it you're going to become
somebody's son-in-law.

06:07.133 --> 06:08.801
Son-in-law?!

06:08.801 --> 06:11.170
Looks like it wasn't just a rumor.

06:11.170 --> 06:13.306
That's just stupid talk!

06:13.306 --> 06:17.076
Yayoi and I aren't getting m-m-m-m, m-m...

06:17.076 --> 06:18.373
Married?

06:24.751 --> 06:26.152
Is something wrong?

06:26.152 --> 06:28.586
No. I guess it was just my imagination.

06:30.390 --> 06:31.958
Oh, that's right!

06:31.958 --> 06:33.960
I've gotta get back and practice
my downward thrusts!

06:33.960 --> 06:35.052
See you, Loki!

06:35.762 --> 06:37.559
Narugami! Wait!

06:44.470 --> 06:45.772
Master Loki?

06:45.772 --> 06:47.507
Is something wrong, Daddy?

06:47.507 --> 06:49.407
It's just...

06:55.415 --> 06:58.213
Good day, Lord Loki.

06:58.684 --> 07:00.353
Verdandi.

07:00.353 --> 07:02.981
Ah. So it was your presence I sensed.

07:03.289 --> 07:06.019
I have come with a new prediction for you.

07:08.694 --> 07:13.028
One life will begin, and another will end.

07:13.933 --> 07:18.563
The evil god will be destroyed by the
fangs of someone close to him.

07:19.739 --> 07:22.230
What are you plotting this time?

07:31.217 --> 07:33.617
The fangs of someone close, huh?

07:33.953 --> 07:35.688
It's not me!

07:35.688 --> 07:37.315
I know that.

07:45.398 --> 07:46.666
More, please!

07:46.666 --> 07:47.633
Certainly.

07:56.776 --> 07:59.479
The plan seems to be going along nicely.

07:59.479 --> 08:02.539
It sure does! He hasn't noticed
a thing, has he?

08:04.016 --> 08:07.315
Let's trust that Verdandi has
the skill to pull this off.

08:16.229 --> 08:19.926
It's so quiet when all the children
go home, isn't it?

08:20.700 --> 08:23.302
Maybe a little too quiet.

08:23.302 --> 08:26.533
C'mon, you bugs! Put some energy
into that chirping!

08:40.520 --> 08:43.648
Well, maybe I should go practice a
few more thrusts or something.

08:46.492 --> 08:49.154
Would you stay here a little longer?

08:56.769 --> 09:02.401
This is the first time in my life
that I've been so happy.

09:03.476 --> 09:06.809
I wonder if I'm much of a help, though.

09:07.146 --> 09:08.943
Yes, very much so.

09:09.282 --> 09:12.184
You're kind and trustworthy.

09:12.184 --> 09:14.482
Just the sort of person I'd been hoping for.

09:15.755 --> 09:18.824
You know, I'm always carrying
a wooden sword around,

09:18.824 --> 09:21.452
so I figured that's why you
asked for my help.

09:27.533 --> 09:29.101
You're wrong.

09:29.101 --> 09:31.501
I did it because I knew.

09:32.004 --> 09:33.972
I knew how kind you are.

09:34.840 --> 09:39.106
I wish we could stay like this forever.

09:53.092 --> 09:54.427
What's wrong, Yayoi?

09:54.427 --> 09:57.123
Oh, it's nothing.

10:02.535 --> 10:04.002
What's the matter?

10:05.738 --> 10:07.039
Narugami.

10:07.039 --> 10:08.107
Yeah?

10:08.107 --> 10:12.578
You won't lose a fight no matter who
your opponent is, will you?

10:12.578 --> 10:15.911
There's no one in this world
you couldn't beat, right?

10:17.617 --> 10:20.152
Of course not! You just leave it...

10:20.152 --> 10:21.642
No, wait a minute.

10:24.090 --> 10:27.627
There is one guy I've never
gone all-out against.

10:27.627 --> 10:29.996
Does this mean you wouldn't fight him?

10:29.996 --> 10:31.430
No, it's not like that!

10:31.430 --> 10:35.368
Someday I'll defeat him and
show him who's best!

10:35.368 --> 10:37.603
Someday? "Someday" isn't good enough!

10:37.603 --> 10:39.468
But, uh...

10:40.506 --> 10:43.242
Well, those guys hook me up
with free meals and stuff.

10:43.242 --> 10:45.369
Plus, I don't have any reason
to fight him right now.

10:46.212 --> 10:47.747
This won't do.

10:47.747 --> 10:52.946
If you don't fight that person,
you'll never be happy.

10:54.520 --> 10:57.648
Fight him. Defeat him!

10:57.990 --> 11:00.493
Prove that you're the strongest.

11:00.493 --> 11:04.953
Then you and I can be together
and protect this dojo.

11:05.665 --> 11:08.463
Be... together?

11:08.668 --> 11:12.627
But for that to happen,
you must defeat your enemy!

11:13.305 --> 11:15.273
I will defeat him.

11:15.808 --> 11:17.673
Loki will fall by my hands!

11:18.177 --> 11:21.635
Yes. Eliminate Loki.

11:40.966 --> 11:44.026
I'm sorry, Narugami.

11:45.271 --> 11:50.231
But after this, I'll be able to be with you.

11:51.177 --> 11:52.804
Forever.

12:08.127 --> 12:10.095
Loki! Fight me!

12:14.700 --> 12:16.936
Be quiet, Narukami.

12:16.936 --> 12:19.605
Get up! We're having a duel!

12:19.605 --> 12:21.072
What's going on, Daddy?

12:21.974 --> 12:23.142
Narugami!

12:23.142 --> 12:23.938
Daddy!

12:25.277 --> 12:28.769
Yamino, wake me when breakfast
is ready, all right?

12:29.448 --> 12:31.550
You're not going back to sleep!

12:31.550 --> 12:33.848
If that's how it is,
I'll take you out like this!

12:34.186 --> 12:36.484
Narugami! Food!

12:42.695 --> 12:44.363
Nutritional replenishment complete.

12:44.363 --> 12:45.990
Now, where was I...

12:46.365 --> 12:48.400
Master Loki, please get up!

12:48.400 --> 12:49.697
Master Loki!

12:50.136 --> 12:51.637
Running away, are you?

12:51.637 --> 12:52.604
Loki!

12:56.208 --> 12:59.109
Stop, Loki! Where did they go?!

13:00.579 --> 13:01.978
They ran off that way.

13:02.214 --> 13:03.841
Thanks, Yayoi!

13:04.250 --> 13:05.717
Go get him!

13:23.536 --> 13:25.436
Stay in control, Frey.

13:25.738 --> 13:27.406
Just leave it to me.

13:27.406 --> 13:31.866
I'm going to win first prize and go on a
hot-springs vacation with my Japanese beauty!

13:32.511 --> 13:35.639
Hey, it's not first prize that we're after.

13:36.315 --> 13:37.082
It's that! The red prize ticket
for a 10-kilo bag of rice!

13:37.082 --> 13:40.916
DVD Player
Silver 2nd
Coupon for 10-lb bag of rice
Red 3rd
Early Riseralarm clock
Blue 4th

13:41.020 --> 13:41.053
Gold 1st
Hot-spring tour with
a Japanese beauty

13:41.053 --> 13:42.688
Gold 1st
Hot-spring tour with
a Japanese beauty
I'll do it through love!

13:42.955 --> 13:45.685
Love will sustain me!

13:47.693 --> 13:49.991
Only one drawing per person.

14:00.606 --> 14:00.940
Everyone's a winner!!
Neighborhood Grand Raffle

14:00.940 --> 14:03.108
Everyone's a winner!!
Neighborhood Grand Raffle
Here you go, one pack of tissues.

14:03.809 --> 14:06.676
These cookies really turned out well.

14:07.880 --> 14:10.280
I'm going to give them to Loki!

14:10.616 --> 14:11.817
Loki!

14:11.817 --> 14:13.853
Fight me fair and square!

14:13.853 --> 14:15.480
Oh, Loki!

14:15.754 --> 14:18.450
Loki, I made these cookies for...

14:23.095 --> 14:24.722
Stop right there!

14:26.265 --> 14:27.299
Wait, you bastard!

14:27.299 --> 14:28.834
Give me back my hot-springs vacation
with my Japanese beauty!
Wait, you bastard!

14:28.834 --> 14:31.170
Give me back my hot-springs vacation
with my Japanese beauty!

14:31.170 --> 14:34.206
Give me back my 10 kilos of rice!

14:34.206 --> 14:36.197
My cookies!

14:36.375 --> 14:39.503
Why did things have to turn out like this?!

14:45.117 --> 14:46.385
Master Loki!

14:46.385 --> 14:48.420
Hurry up and wake him before they find us!

14:48.420 --> 14:50.217
Please wake up, Master Loki!

14:51.957 --> 14:53.893
Is breakfast ready?

14:53.893 --> 14:58.464
This is hardly the time!
Narugami is acting very strangely!

14:58.464 --> 15:00.091
Narukami is?

15:01.433 --> 15:02.730
Big brother!

15:04.003 --> 15:07.439
You're going to fight me, Loki.

15:09.074 --> 15:11.542
Narukami. Your eyes...

15:15.547 --> 15:17.208
Watch out, Master Loki!

15:19.485 --> 15:20.952
Yamino!

15:23.355 --> 15:25.482
I just hit them with the back of the sword.

15:26.792 --> 15:28.127
All right.

15:28.127 --> 15:31.494
I'll do what you want and settle this.

15:32.164 --> 15:34.564
This is the day that I defeat you!

16:03.429 --> 16:04.563
Why is she here?

16:04.563 --> 16:07.862
Yayoi will be a witness to our duel.

16:10.803 --> 16:15.172
I'm surprised the thunder god Thor
would lose himself like this.

16:29.421 --> 16:30.718
Let's go, Loki!

16:34.493 --> 16:36.723
Not bad. How about this?!

16:41.300 --> 16:43.097
Snap out of it, Narukami!

16:43.335 --> 16:44.436
Quiet!

16:44.436 --> 16:46.638
If you've got the time to talk nonsense,

16:46.638 --> 16:48.731
you've got the time to fight me!

16:49.041 --> 16:50.099
Narugami!

16:58.283 --> 17:00.308
That's the way, Narugami!

17:00.719 --> 17:03.688
I see. So that's how it is, huh?

17:12.231 --> 17:15.029
Loki! What the hell are you doing?!

17:15.768 --> 17:18.066
Yayoi's got nothing to do with this!

17:18.370 --> 17:19.268
Narukami!

17:19.538 --> 17:21.335
I won't forgive this!

17:32.484 --> 17:35.112
Roar, Mjolnir!

17:37.856 --> 17:39.323
Laevateinn!

17:54.773 --> 17:58.903
Narukami! That moment when you looked
over at Yayoi was your undoing!

18:08.420 --> 18:10.820
Why did you pause, Loki?

18:11.356 --> 18:13.824
I told you this duel is for real!

18:14.460 --> 18:16.087
This is wrong.

18:16.361 --> 18:19.330
That's not Narugami.

18:32.177 --> 18:36.136
There's no reason for us to
settle things like this.

18:37.349 --> 18:42.810
This Narukami, isn't the
Narukami that I know!

18:44.756 --> 18:46.223
Stop it.

18:46.825 --> 18:48.622
Stop it!

18:52.464 --> 18:53.431
Yayoi!

19:00.038 --> 19:01.807
This is wrong.

19:01.807 --> 19:06.608
This is not the Narugami that I love.

19:08.947 --> 19:13.441
The one I love is gentle and cheerful.

19:14.019 --> 19:18.080
Please, go back to being
the Narugami that I...

19:23.495 --> 19:24.894
Yayoi...

19:25.230 --> 19:27.460
That doll has failed me.

19:29.935 --> 19:33.928
I gave her life, and yet she betrayed me.

19:34.406 --> 19:36.874
What have you done, damn you?!

19:46.618 --> 19:47.915
Narukami...

19:48.387 --> 19:52.357
All this fighting has exhausted
the both of you.

19:52.357 --> 19:57.158
With this magic ball, Skirnir,
I should be able to defeat you with ease!

20:02.701 --> 20:04.803
It's no use, Thor.

20:04.803 --> 20:09.263
I shall use your power of lightning
against you and reduce you to ashes!

20:10.909 --> 20:12.672
And you as well, Lord Loki.

20:31.597 --> 20:37.229
I'm sorry. I just wanted to
be with you, Narugami.

20:38.770 --> 20:43.230
You were always so kind to me.

20:46.612 --> 20:49.911
It was delightful.

20:50.582 --> 20:56.111
I'll never forget the time
I spent with y...

20:59.258 --> 21:01.385
I don't believe it.

21:01.760 --> 21:05.491
How could the doll have moved
after I withdrew life from her?

21:08.600 --> 21:13.060
Did you think this would work against
Thor, the thunder god?!

21:23.382 --> 21:24.906
Got away, huh?

22:16.935 --> 22:28.904
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.615 --> 22:42.361
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.361 --> 22:49.468
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.468 --> 22:55.907
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.907 --> 23:05.417
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.417 --> 23:09.755
Even if we're hurt

23:09.755 --> 23:21.767
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.767 --> 23:23.496
Believe in Heaven

23:31.276 --> 23:32.511
Next Episode

23:32.511 --> 23:36.114
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are
"shoes," "memories" and "banana parfait."

23:36.114 --> 23:37.849
Next Episode
I heard you started taking
ballet lessons, Reiya.

23:37.849 --> 23:38.650
Next Episode
That's right!

23:38.650 --> 23:39.985
Next Episode
I have too!

23:39.985 --> 23:41.186
Next Episode
You started ballet?

23:41.186 --> 23:42.254
Next Episode
No, my own dance.

23:42.254 --> 23:43.021
Next Episode
Dance?

23:43.021 --> 23:44.689
Next Episode
A dance that brings happiness!

23:44.689 --> 23:48.160
Next Episode
I ring a bell and circle around a torch!

23:48.160 --> 23:53.932
Next Episode
I chant, "How could I not get my revenge?
Hahoro, paporo, ondorori!"

23:53.932 --> 23:55.467
Next Episode
It's so much fun!

23:55.467 --> 23:56.067
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.067 --> 23:56.768
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.768 --> 23:57.135
The 20th Night
The Red Shoes
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:57.135 --> 23:58.403
The 20th Night
The Red Shoes
"The Red Shoes"

23:58.403 --> 24:00.539
The 20th Night
The Red Shoes
Another strange mystery!

24:00.539 --> 24:01.130
The 20th Night
The Red Shoes
